{#
  Guarden's own keep-id drop-in (ADR-0019).

  The pin lives in a FILE of its own and not in the base unit: the base unit
  carries no `UserNS=` line at all, and the only two files in this directory
  are guarden's and the admin's. Quadlet merges drop-ins in alphabetical
  order and the last one wins, so `50-guarden-keepid.conf` is the pin and
  `90-admin.conf` — the human's own file, which guarden never writes and
  never deletes — is what overrides it.

  The `[Container]` header is not decoration: the merge is a concatenation
  (quadlet(5)), so a file with no header at all would put its key in
  whichever section the file before it ended in, and the rendered base unit
  ends in `[Service]`.
#}
# Rendered by loom for {{ service }}. Do not edit: the next render overwrites
# this file, and the mutator installs it into the admin path.

[Pod]
UserNS={{ owner }}
